Package: skyops
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SkyOps Node - GPU monitoring and management tool
 SkyOps Node is a command-line tool for monitoring and managing GPU resources.
 It provides real-time monitoring, system information collection, and integration
 with the SkyOps platform for cloud GPU management.
 .
 The node software automatically installs to ~/.skyops and adds itself to the system PATH.
